0..64 Comment "// Descent on the parameter a definition\'s matches take apart. A"
65..140 Comment "// recursive definition descends on the parameter the innermost match above"
141..220 Comment "// each of its claims scrutinises: the first one, with the accumulator after it"
221..297 Comment "// varying from call to call, or a value rebuilt from the match\'s fields, so"
298..375 Comment "// long as it stands below the parameter the match took apart. The parameters"
376..451 Comment "// before the staged one are passed unchanged; descent on two parameters at"
452..499 Comment "// once is the sized rung\'s. What refuses is in"
500..543 Comment "// `../../pathological/data/descent.gandr`."
544..546 Comment "//"
547..561 Comment "// - see: #518"
562..576 Comment "// - see: #392"
577..610 Comment "// - see: #2127 — `reverseOnto`"
611..641 Comment "// - see: #2135 — `pairwise`"
642..676 Comment "// - see: #2833 — `isZeroAtZero`"
